<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"YEN\u0130 Parti\u2019de 13 il\u00e7ede ba\u015fkanlar belli oldu","articleSection":"\u0130ZM\u0130R G\u00dcNCEL","dateCreated":"2026-10-04T18:59:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-04T18:59:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-04T19:48:08+03:00","wordCount":2984,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/dokuzeylul.com\/yeni-partide-heyecan-dorukta"},"articleBody":"YEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir\u2019de il\u00e7e kongre maratonunun en yo\u011fun g\u00fcnlerinden biri geride kald\u0131. Pazar g\u00fcn\u00fc Bergama, Bornova, Buca, \u00c7e\u015fme, \u00c7i\u011fli, G\u00fczelbah\u00e7e, Kar\u015f\u0131yaka, Menemen, Narl\u0131dere, Seferihisar, Tire, Torbal\u0131 ve Urla olmak \u00fczere 13 il\u00e7ede kongreler ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirildi. 26-27 Eyl\u00fcl tarihlerinde yap\u0131lan il\u00e7e ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6n se\u00e7imlerinden \u00e7\u0131kan isimler, kongrelerde tek aday olarak delegelerin kar\u015f\u0131s\u0131na \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131. G\u00fcn boyunca devam eden kongrelerin tamamlanmas\u0131yla 13 il\u00e7enin ba\u015fkanlar\u0131, yeni y\u00f6netimleri ve il kongresinde oy kullanacak delegeleri b\u00fcy\u00fck \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcde \u015fekillendi.\r\n\r\n\u0130\u015fte 13 il\u00e7enin ba\u015fkanlar\u0131\r\n\r\nPazar g\u00fcn\u00fc ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen kongrelerin ard\u0131ndan il\u00e7e ba\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131nda ortaya \u00e7\u0131kan tablo \u015f\u00f6yle:\r\n\r\nBergama: \u0130smail Durmaz\r\nBornova: M\u00fcbeccel Tima\u00e7\r\nBuca: H\u00fcseyin Duyan\r\n\u00c7e\u015fme: Seyit Dolunay Onur\r\n\u00c7i\u011fli: Erkan Akar\r\nG\u00fczelbah\u00e7e: Altan G\u00fczel\r\nKar\u015f\u0131yaka: Levent G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc\r\nMenemen: H\u00fcseyin \u00d6zbey\r\nNarl\u0131dere: Mesut Durgun\r\nSeferihisar: B\u00fclent Halis Bozkurt\r\nTire: Ersin G\u00fcng\u00f6r\r\nTorbal\u0131: \u0130brahim \u00d6zel\r\nUrla: Ahmet Bahri Yalaz\r\n\r\nBornova\u2019da \u00f6n se\u00e7imden \u00e7\u0131kan M\u00fcbeccel Tima\u00e7 kongreye tek aday olarak girerken, yeni y\u00f6netim kurulu ile 65 ki\u015filik il delege listesi de belli oldu. Bornova Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u00d6mer E\u015fki, eski milletvekili ve eski belediye ba\u015fkan\u0131 Kamil Okyay S\u0131nd\u0131r, kurucu il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ert\u00fcrk \u00c7ap\u0131n ve eski Bornova Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Olgun Atila da il delege listesinde yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\nG\u00fczelbah\u00e7e\u2019de Altan G\u00fczel d\u00f6nemi\r\n\r\nG\u00fczelbah\u00e7e\u2019de ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen kongrede Altan G\u00fczel tek aday olarak delegelerin kar\u015f\u0131s\u0131na \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131. Kongrenin ard\u0131ndan G\u00fczel, il\u00e7e ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revine se\u00e7ildi. 13 ki\u015filik il delege listesinde Belediye Ba\u015fkan Vekili Ay\u015fe Ak\u0131n ve eski il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 Bilgin Akdo\u011fan da yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\nKar\u015f\u0131yaka\u2019da ise Levent G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc ile yola devam edildi. G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc\u2019n\u00fcn haz\u0131rlad\u0131\u011f\u0131 listede gen\u00e7 ve kad\u0131n isimlere a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k verilirken, eski Kar\u015f\u0131yaka Belediye Ba\u015fkanlar\u0131 Cevat Durak ve Cihan T\u00fcrsen ile eski \u0130zmir Milletvekili Sabri Erg\u00fcl il delegeleri aras\u0131nda yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\nTire\u2019de g\u00f6rev Ersin G\u00fcng\u00f6r\u2019de\r\n\r\nTire\u2019de kongre s\u00fcrecinin ard\u0131ndan Ersin G\u00fcng\u00f6r yeni d\u00f6nemin il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 oldu. G\u00fcng\u00f6r, daha \u00f6nce ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen \u00f6n se\u00e7imde kurucu il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fcrol Soyuer\u2019i 434 oy alarak geride b\u0131rakm\u0131\u015ft\u0131. Kongreye tek aday olarak giren G\u00fcng\u00f6r\u2019\u00fcn y\u00f6netim kurulu da belirlendi.\r\n\r\nSoyuer ise kongrede yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 konu\u015fmada \u00f6n se\u00e7im sonucunu kabul ettiklerini belirterek yeni y\u00f6netime destek vereceklerini a\u00e7\u0131klad\u0131. G\u00fcng\u00f6r de yeni d\u00f6nemde eski ba\u015fkanlar ve t\u00fcm \u00fcyelerle birlikte \u00e7al\u0131\u015facaklar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\nTorbal\u0131 ve Urla\u2019da listeler dikkat \u00e7ekti\r\n\r\nTorbal\u0131\u2019da \u0130brahim \u00d6zel tek aday olarak kongreye girerken, 18 ki\u015filik il delege listesinde Torbal\u0131 Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u00d6v\u00fcn\u00e7 Demir ve eski il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u015eeng\u00fcl Babacan da yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\nUrla\u2019da ise Ahmet Bahri Yalaz\u2019\u0131n tek aday oldu\u011fu kongrenin divan ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 eski \u0130zmir Milletvekili Alaattin Y\u00fcksel yapt\u0131. Yalaz\u2019\u0131n 24 ki\u015filik il delege listesinde Urla Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Sel\u00e7uk Balkan, eski \u0130zmir B\u00fcy\u00fck\u015fehir Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Aziz Kocao\u011flu ile eski milletvekilleri Alaattin Y\u00fcksel ve T\u00fcrkan Mi\u00e7oo\u011fullar\u0131 yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\nKongre maratonunda sona gelindi\r\n\r\nPazar g\u00fcn\u00fc 13 il\u00e7edeki kongrelerin tamamlanmas\u0131yla YEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir\u2019de il\u00e7e kongre takviminde sona yakla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131. Daha \u00f6nce \u00fcye say\u0131s\u0131 400\u2019\u00fcn alt\u0131nda bulunan Bay\u0131nd\u0131r, Beyda\u011f, K\u0131n\u0131k ve Kiraz\u2019da \u00f6n se\u00e7im yap\u0131lmadan kongre s\u00fcre\u00e7leri tamamlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131.\r\n\r\nTakvime g\u00f6re 5 Ekim\u2019de Fo\u00e7a, 6 Ekim\u2019de ise \u00d6demi\u015f kongrelerinin yap\u0131lmas\u0131yla \u0130zmir\u2019deki il\u00e7e kongre s\u00fcrecinin tamamlanmas\u0131 planlan\u0131yor. Yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lan metin\r\n\r\n\u0130l\u00e7e kongrelerinin ard\u0131ndan YEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcnde bu kez g\u00f6zler, il\u00e7elerden se\u00e7ilen delegelerin oy kullanaca\u011f\u0131 \u0130zmir \u0130l Kongresi\u2019ne \u00e7evrilecek.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBORNOVA\r\n\r\nYeni Parti Bornova \u0130l\u00e7e ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na M\u00fcbeccel Tima\u00e7 se\u00e7ildi. PYeni Parti'den yap\u0131lan a\u00e7\u0131klamada \u015fu ifadeylere yer verildi: Yeni Parti Bornova \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 olarak 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l\u00e7e Kongremizi birlik, beraberlik ve b\u00fcy\u00fck bir co\u015fku i\u00e7erisinde tamamlad\u0131k. Delegelerimizin tevecc\u00fchleriyle Bornova \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na se\u00e7ilen Say\u0131n M\u00fcbeccel Tima\u00e7\u2019\u0131, yeni y\u00f6netim kurulumuzu ve il delegelerimizi tebrik ediyor; yeni d\u00f6nemde ba\u015far\u0131lar diliyorum. G\u00f6revini devreden ve kongremizde Divan Ba\u015fkan\u0131 olarak bizleri yaln\u0131z b\u0131rakmayan Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Say\u0131n Av. Ert\u00fcrk \u00c7ap\u0131n\u2019a, kurucu il\u00e7e y\u00f6netim kurulumuza ve bu s\u00fcrece emek veren t\u00fcm \u00fcyelerimize te\u015fekk\u00fcr ediyorum. \u015eimdi yeni bir d\u00f6neme, ortak ak\u0131l, dayan\u0131\u015fma ve birlik i\u00e7erisinde hep birlikte y\u00fcr\u00fcyoruz. Rotam\u0131z; Bornova\u2019m\u0131z\u0131n t\u00fcm bile\u015fenleriyle birlikte partimizi iktidara ta\u015f\u0131makt\u0131r. Bornova\u2019m\u0131z ve partimiz i\u00e7in yolumuz a\u00e7\u0131k, birli\u011fimiz g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc, ba\u015far\u0131lar\u0131m\u0131z daim olsun.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBERGAMA\r\n\r\nBergama il\u00e7e kongresi Ziraat Odas\u0131 Toplant\u0131 Salonu\u2019nda yap\u0131ld\u0131.. Kongrede \u0130smail Durmaz tek aday oldu. Kongrenin divan ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 eski belediye ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mehmet G\u00f6nen\u00e7 \u00fcstlendi. G\u00f6nen\u00e7 yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 k\u0131sa de\u011ferlendirmede, parti i\u00e7i demokrasinin ve se\u00e7im y\u00f6ntemlerinin \u00f6nemine de\u011finirken; T\u00fcrkiye'deki siyasi g\u00fcndeme, yerel y\u00f6netimlerde ya\u015fanan s\u00fcre\u00e7lere ve muhalefetin dayan\u0131\u015fma i\u00e7inde hareket etmesinin gereklili\u011fine vurgu yapt\u0131.\r\n\r\nA\u011fustos ay\u0131nda kurucu il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 olarak g\u00f6revlendirildi\u011fini hat\u0131rlata Durmaz, bu s\u00fcre\u00e7te yo\u011fun bir \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma y\u00fcr\u00fctt\u00fcklerini ifade ederek, \"\u0130l\u00e7e ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bir makam de\u011fildir, bir emanettir. Y\u00f6netim kurulu bir ayr\u0131cal\u0131k de\u011fildir, bir sorumluluktur. Delege olmak bir \u00fcst\u00fcnl\u00fck de\u011fildir, \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcn iradesini temsil etmektir. G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc \u00f6rg\u00fct, g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc liderlikten \u00f6nce g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc kat\u0131l\u0131mla kurulur. Bergama\u2019y\u0131 dinlemeden Bergama\u2019ya s\u00f6z s\u00f6ylemeyece\u011fiz. Siyasetimizi yaln\u0131zca parti binas\u0131nda de\u011fil; sokakta, tarlada, d\u00fckk\u00e2nda, pazarda, mahallede ve hayat\u0131n i\u00e7inde yapaca\u011f\u0131z. Bug\u00fcn burada tek aday olmam\u0131z, ortak akl\u0131n ve kurulu\u015f s\u00fcrecinde olu\u015fan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma iradesinin bir sonucu olarak \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczde duruyor. Ama tek aday olmak, tek ses olmak anlam\u0131na gelmez. Tam tersine, tek hedef etraf\u0131nda farkl\u0131 fikirlerin \u00f6zg\u00fcrce konu\u015fabildi\u011fi bir \u00f6rg\u00fct olmak zorunday\u0131z. Bu ba\u015flang\u0131c\u0131n ad\u0131 dayan\u0131\u015fma olsun. Bu \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcn temelinde adalet olsun. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fma k\u00fclt\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fczde \u015feffafl\u0131k olsun. Kararlar\u0131m\u0131zda ortak ak\u0131l olsun. Ve Bergama\u2019daki siyaset anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131m\u0131zda insan olsun.\" diye konu\u015ftu.\r\n\r\n\u0130smail Durmaz'\u0131n il\u00e7e y\u00f6netim kurulu asil ve yedek listesi ile 13 ki\u015filik il delege listesi belli oldu.\r\n\r\nBA\u015eKANLAR L\u0130STEDE\r\n\r\n\u0130l delege listesinde \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u0130smail Durmaz\u2019\u0131n yan\u0131 s\u0131ra Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Tanju \u00c7elik, eski belediye ba\u015fkanlar\u0131 Mehmet G\u00f6nen\u00e7 ve Sefa Ta\u015fk\u0131n ile belediye ba\u015fkan aday\u0131 \u0130dris Yavuzy\u0131lmaz ile eski il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mehmet Ecevit Canbaz, Bahri Kalyoncu ile \u00d6zcan Durmaz Kad\u0131n Kollar\u0131 eski ba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fczin Ayd\u0131nyer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\nDurmaz'\u0131n y\u00f6netim listesinde yer alan isimler \u015f\u00f6yle:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBornova'da M\u00fcbeccel Tima\u00e7'\u0131n ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndaki yeni y\u00f6netim ile il kongresi delegeleri belirlenirken, il delegesi listesinde \u0130zmir siyasetinin dikkat \u00e7eken isimlerinin bulunmas\u0131 kongrenin \u00f6ne \u00e7\u0131kan geli\u015fmelerinden biri oldu.\r\n\r\nBUCA\r\n\r\nBuca il\u00e7e kongresi Buca \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 Binas\u0131'nda yap\u0131ld\u0131. Kongrede Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Suat Bulut\u2019u \u00f6n se\u00e7imde geride b\u0131rakarak sand\u0131ktan birinci \u00e7\u0131kan H\u00fcseyin Duyan tek aday oldu. Duyan'\u0131n il delege listesinde Suat Bulut da yer alma\u0131s dikkat \u00e7ekti. \u0130\u015fte Duyan'\u0131n y\u00f6netim y\u00f6netim listesinde yer alan isimler:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u00c7E\u015eME\r\n\r\n\u00c7e\u015fme il\u00e7e kongresi \u00c7akabey K\u00fclt\u00fcr Merkezi'nde yap\u0131ld\u0131. Kongrede S. Dolunay Onur tek aday oldu. Se\u00e7ime tek aday olarak giren Seyit Dolunay Onur'un listesinde Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 L\u00e2l Denizli ve eski il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 Sait Kavaso\u011fullar ve Halil Saatl\u0131 da yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u00c7\u0130\u011eL\u0130\r\n\r\n\u00c7i\u011fli il\u00e7e kongresi Fakir Bayburt Konferans Salonu\u2019nda yap\u0131ld\u0131. Kongrede Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Erkan Akar tek aday. Kongrenin divan ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \u0130l Ba\u015fkan vekili Murat Ayd\u0131n yapt\u0131. Akar'\u0131n y\u00f6netim kurulu listesinde yer alan isimler belli oldu:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKAR\u015eIYAKA\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 PART\u0130 Kar\u015f\u0131yaka'da Levent G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc se\u00e7imi kazanan isim oldu. Kongreye kat\u0131lan Yeni Parti \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u00c7a\u011fatay G\u00fc\u00e7, kongre sonras\u0131nda \u015fu a\u00e7\u0131klamay\u0131 yapt\u0131: YEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir\u2019de ilk il\u00e7e kongrelerimizin heyecan\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcm\u00fczle birlikte ya\u015f\u0131yoruz! Pazar g\u00fcnk\u00fc kongre program\u0131m\u0131z\u0131n ilk dura\u011f\u0131 Kar\u015f\u0131yaka\u2019da, delegelerimizin kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla il\u00e7e kongremizi ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftiriyoruz. Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Levent G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc\u2019n\u00fcn tek aday oldu\u011fu kongremizde delegelerimiz oylar\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131yor. Kongremizin Kar\u015f\u0131yaka\u2019ya, \u0130zmir \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcm\u00fcze ve partimize hay\u0131rl\u0131, u\u011furlu olmas\u0131n\u0131 diliyorum. Partimizin kurulu\u015fundan bug\u00fcne emek veren t\u00fcm yol arkada\u015flar\u0131ma te\u015fekk\u00fcr ediyorum. Her kongrede \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcm\u00fcz\u00fc g\u00fc\u00e7lendiriyor, iktidar kararl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fct\u00fcyoruz. \u00dcyelerimizin iradesi ve \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcm\u00fcz\u00fcn eme\u011fiyle y\u00fckselen YEN\u0130 Parti\u2019yi, milletimizle birlikte iktidara ta\u015f\u0131yaca\u011f\u0131z!\r\n\r\nKar\u015f\u0131yaka'da ise kurucu il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 Levent G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc, kongrede oy kullanan 329 delegenin 322'sinin oyunu alarak yeniden il\u00e7e ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na se\u00e7ildi. 7 oy ge\u00e7ersiz say\u0131ld\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u00c7i\u011fli'de de kurucu il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 Erkan Akar ile devam karar\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131. \u00c7e\u015fme'de ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen oylaman\u0131n ard\u0131ndan Seyit Dolunay Onur ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndaki yeni y\u00f6netim ve il kongresi delegeleri kesinle\u015fti.\r\n\r\nG\u00dcZELBAH\u00c7E\r\n\r\nG\u00fczelbah\u00e7e il\u00e7e kongresi Atat\u00fcrk K\u00fclt\u00fcr Merkezi Tuncel Kurtiz Salonu\u2019nda yap\u0131ld\u0131. Kongrede Altan G\u00fczel tek aday oldu. Kongrede \u0130zmir eski Milletvekili Erdal Karademir, Belediye Ba\u015fkan Vekili Ay\u015fe Ak\u0131n ve meclis \u00fcyesi \u00c7a\u011flayan Bilgen birer konu\u015fma yapt\u0131. Faaliyet raporu falan oyland\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAy\u015fe Ak\u0131n, \"Yeni Parti G\u00fczelbah\u00e7e \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z\u0131n 1. Ola\u011fan Kongresi\u2019ni, \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Say\u0131n \u00c7a\u011fatay G\u00fc\u00e7\u2019\u00fcn kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirdik.\u0130ktidar yolundaki ilk ad\u0131m\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 hep birlikte att\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z kongremizde, \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revine se\u00e7ilen Altan G\u00fczel\u2019i ve yeni y\u00f6netimini kutluyor, ba\u015far\u0131lar diliyorum. G\u00f6revini devreden Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Bilgin Akdo\u011fan\u2019a ve y\u00f6netimine emekleri i\u00e7in; Divan\u0131m\u0131za, \u00fcyelerimize ve t\u00fcm yol arkada\u015flar\u0131m\u0131za katk\u0131lar\u0131 i\u00e7in te\u015fekk\u00fcr ediyorum.Yeni d\u00f6nemin partimize ve G\u00fczelbah\u00e7e\u2019mize hay\u0131rl\u0131 olmas\u0131n\u0131 diliyorum.G\u00fczel g\u00fcnler bizim olacak!\" dedi. 13 ki\u015filik il delege listesinde Altan G\u00fczel d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda, Belediye Ba\u015fkan Vekili Ay\u015fe Ak\u0131n, eski il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 Bilgin Akdo\u011fan da yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMENEMEN\r\n\r\nMenemen il\u00e7e kongresi Menemen Belediyesi K\u00fclt\u00fcr Merkezi\u2019nde yap\u0131ld\u0131. Kongrede Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 H\u00fcseyin \u00d6zbey tek aday oldu.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u00d6zbey, \"Yeni Parti Menemen \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 olarak, yeni d\u00f6nemde g\u00f6rev yapacak \u0130l\u00e7e Y\u00f6netim Kurulu \u00fcyelerimizi ve \u0130l Delegelerimizi demokratik bir se\u00e7imle belirledik. Ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen se\u00e7im sonucunda g\u00f6rev alan t\u00fcm yol arkada\u015flar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 tebrik ediyor, \u00fcstlendikleri sorumlulu\u011fun partimiz ve Menemen\u2019imiz ad\u0131na hay\u0131rl\u0131 olmas\u0131n\u0131 diliyoruz. Birlik, beraberlik ve ortak ak\u0131l anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131yla \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 kararl\u0131l\u0131kla s\u00fcrd\u00fcrece\u011fiz.Se\u00e7imimize kat\u0131l\u0131m g\u00f6steren t\u00fcm yol arkada\u015flar\u0131ma te\u015fekk\u00fcr ediyor, yeni d\u00f6nemin partimize ve Menemen\u2019imize hay\u0131rl\u0131 olmas\u0131n\u0131 temenni ediyorum.\" dedi\r\n\r\n\u00d6zbey'in listesinde \u015fu isimler yer ald\u0131:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNARLIDERE\r\n\r\nNarl\u0131dere il\u00e7e kongresi Malatyal\u0131lar Derne\u011fi Toplant\u0131 Salonu\u2019nda yap\u0131ld\u0131.. Kongrede Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mesut Durgun tek aday oldu. Kongrenin divan ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 eski il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u015eahin F\u0131rat \u00fcstlendi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir Milletvekili Ednan Arslan, \u201cYEN\u0130 Partimizin Narl\u0131dere \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresinde yol arkada\u015flar\u0131m\u0131zla bir araya geldik.Partimizin ad\u0131n\u0131 milletimiz koydu, yolumuzu halk\u0131m\u0131z a\u00e7t\u0131.Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Say\u0131n \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel\u2019in liderli\u011finde; s\u00f6z\u00fcn, yetkinin ve karar\u0131n \u00fcyelerimizde oldu\u011fu yeni siyaset anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131m\u0131zla iktidara y\u00fcr\u00fcyoruz.Hep birlikte halk\u0131n iktidar\u0131n\u0131 kuraca\u011f\u0131z!\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSEFER\u0130H\u0130SAR\r\n\r\nSeferihisar il\u00e7e kongresi Seferihisar Belediyesi K\u00fclt\u00fcr Merkezi\u2019nde yap\u0131ld\u0131. Kongrede Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Rahmi Tezel \u00c7\u0131nar aday olmazken, B\u00fclent Halis Bozkurt tek aday oldu.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u00c7a\u011fatay G\u00fc\u00e7, \u201cYEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir\u2019de il\u00e7e kongrelerimize Seferihisar ile devam ediyoruz. \u0130l y\u00f6neticilerimiz ve yol arkada\u015flar\u0131m\u0131zla birlikte Seferihisar \u0130l\u00e7e Kongremizi ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftiriyoruz. \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z B\u00fclent Halis Bozkurt\u2019un tek aday oldu\u011fu kongremizde delegelerimiz oylar\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131yor. Kongremizin Seferihisar\u2019a, \u0130zmir\u2019imize ve partimize hay\u0131rl\u0131 olmas\u0131n\u0131 diliyorum. Seferihisar\u2019da demokrasinin g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc ve ortak irademizi b\u00fcy\u00fct\u00fcyoruz. Halk\u0131n s\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fc, iradesini ve umudunu iktidara ta\u015f\u0131yaca\u011f\u0131m\u0131z g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc bir gelecek i\u00e7in hep birlikte y\u00fcr\u00fcyoruz.\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nT\u0130RE\r\n\r\nTire il\u00e7e kongresi Hangar \u00c7ok Ama\u00e7l\u0131 Salon\u2019da yap\u0131ld\u0131. Oy kullanma i\u015flemi saat 17:30'a kadar s\u00fcrd\u00fc. YEN\u0130 Parti Tire \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi'nde divan ba\u015fkan\u0131 Eski Bakan Halil \u00c7ulhao\u011flu oldu. Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fcrol Soyuer\u2019e kar\u015f\u0131 se\u00e7imde 434 oy olarak yeni il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 se\u00e7ilen il\u00e7e y\u00f6neticisi Ersin G\u00fcng\u00f6r'\u00fcn y\u00f6netim kurulu listesi belli oldu. \u0130\u015fte G\u00fcng\u00f6r'\u00fcn listesinde yer alan isimler:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTORBALI\r\n\r\nTorbal\u0131 il\u00e7e kongresi Ayd\u0131n Sezer \u00c7ok Ama\u00e7l\u0131 Salon\u2019da yap\u0131ld\u0131. Kongrede se\u00e7ime Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u0130brahim \u00d6zel tek aday olarak girdi. Kongreye ilgi yo\u011fun oldu.\r\n\r\nDEM\u0130R: EN G\u00dc\u00c7L\u00dc ADIMLARLA \u0130KT\u0130DARA Y\u00dcR\u00dcYECE\u011e\u0130Z\r\n\r\nTorbal\u0131 Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u00d6v\u00fcn\u00e7 Demir, \u201cBuradan sesleniyorum. Aya\u011fa kalk Torbal\u0131, aya\u011fa kalk. Aya\u011fa kalk ve tarih yaz Torbal\u0131. Hep birlikte ba\u015faraca\u011f\u0131z. Mutlaka ba\u015faraca\u011f\u0131z. Haydi \u015fimdi hep beraber en g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc ad\u0131mlarla iktidara y\u00fcr\u00fcyece\u011fiz. Yolunuz a\u00e7\u0131k olsun. Yolumuz iktidar yolu olsun. Y\u00fcr\u00fcyelim arkada\u015flar.\u201d dedi. \u0130brahim \u00d6zel'in 18 il delege lsitesinde Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u00d6v\u00fcn\u00e7 Demir ve eski il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u015eeng\u00fcl Babacan da yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nG\u00f6zler di\u011fer il\u00e7elerde\r\n\r\nPazar g\u00fcn\u00fc kongre takviminde yer alan di\u011fer il\u00e7elerde ise s\u00fcre\u00e7 yak\u0131ndan takip ediliyor. Buca'da \u00f6n se\u00e7imi 1.403 oyla kazanan H\u00fcseyin Duyan kongreye tek aday olarak girerken, G\u00fczelbah\u00e7e'de \u00f6n se\u00e7imden 515 oyla \u00e7\u0131kan Altan G\u00fczel'in kongre s\u00fcreci devam ediyor. Menemen'de H\u00fcseyin \u00d6zbey'in y\u00f6netim kurulu ve il kongresi delegesi aday listeleri a\u00e7\u0131kland\u0131. Narl\u0131dere'de Mesut Durgun, Seferihisar'da B\u00fclent Halis Bozkurt, Tire'de Ersin G\u00fcng\u00f6r, Torbal\u0131'da \u0130brahim \u00d6zel ve Urla'da Ahmet Bahri Yalaz kongre s\u00fcrecine \u00f6n se\u00e7imlerden \u00e7\u0131kan isimler olarak girdi. \u00d6zellikle Buca, G\u00fczelbah\u00e7e, Menemen, Narl\u0131dere, Seferihisar, Tire, Torbal\u0131 ve Urla'dan gelecek kesin sonu\u00e7larla birlikte pazar g\u00fcn\u00fc ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen 13 kongrenin tablosu tamamlanacak.\r\n\r\nURLA\r\n\r\nUrla il\u00e7e kongresi Urla Atat\u00fcrk K\u00fclt\u00fcr Merkezi\u2019nde yap\u0131ld\u0131. Kongrede Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ahmet Bahri Yalaz tek aday oldu.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKongrenin divan ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \u0130zmir eski Milletvekili Alaattin Y\u00fcksel \u00fcstlendi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nY\u00dcCEL'DEN \u0130KT\u0130DAR VURGUSU\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti PM \u00dcyesi ve \u0130zmir Milletvekili Deniz Y\u00fccel, \u201cUrla il\u00e7e kongremizde Yeni Partinin cesur, mert ve \u00e7al\u0131\u015fkan, Mustafa Kemal Atat\u00fcrk ve Cumhuriyet sevdal\u0131s\u0131 \u00fcyeleriyle bir araya geldik. \u0130zmir milletvekilimiz Ednan Arslan, Urla Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Sel\u00e7uk Balkan, ge\u00e7mi\u015f d\u00f6nem B\u00fcy\u00fck\u015fehir Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Aziz Kocao\u011flu, ge\u00e7mi\u015f d\u00f6nem milletvekilimiz T\u00fcrkan Mi\u00e7oo\u011fullar\u0131, Alaattin Y\u00fcksel, ge\u00e7mi\u015f d\u00f6nem Buca Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Ertan Erdek ve \u00e7ok say\u0131da partilimizin kat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 kongremizde iktidar olmaktaki kararl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 bir kez daha vurgulad\u0131k!\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir Milletvekili Ednan Arslan, \u201cYEN\u0130 Partimizin Urla \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresindeyiz.Biz bu yola; siyaseti yeniden milletin s\u00f6z\u00fcyle, iradesiyle ve karar\u0131yla bulu\u015fturmak, halk\u0131n iktidar\u0131n\u0131 kurmak i\u00e7in \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131k. Birileri \u201cmutlak butlan\u201d, birileri \u201cmutlak sultan\u201d dedi...Biz ise d\u00fcn oldu\u011fu gibi bug\u00fcn de \u201cEgemenlik kay\u0131ts\u0131z \u015farts\u0131z milletindir!\u201d diyoruz. YEN\u0130 Parti iktidar\u0131, halk\u0131n iktidar\u0131 olacak!\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\nKOCAO\u011eLU VE Y\u00dcKSEL L\u0130STEDE\r\n\r\nYalaz'\u0131n 24 ki\u015filik il delege listesinde Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Sel\u00e7uk Balkan, \u0130zmir B\u00fcy\u00fck\u015fehir Belediyesi eski Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Aziz Kocao\u011flu, eski \u0130zmir milletvekilleri Alattin Y\u00fcksel ve T\u00fcrkan Mi\u00e7oo\u011fullar\u0131 da yer ald\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKongre maratonu s\u00fcrecek\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir'deki kongre s\u00fcreci pazar g\u00fcn\u00fcyle sona ermeyecek. Takvime g\u00f6re 5 Ekim Pazartesi g\u00fcn\u00fc Fo\u00e7a, 6 Ekim Sal\u0131 g\u00fcn\u00fc ise \u00d6demi\u015f kongresinin ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilmesi planlan\u0131yor. Bu kongrelerin de tamamlanmas\u0131n\u0131n ard\u0131ndan \u0130zmir'deki il\u00e7e kongre maratonunda \u00f6nemli bir a\u015fama geride b\u0131rak\u0131lm\u0131\u015f olacak. \u0130l\u00e7elerde belirlenen delegeler a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan bundan sonraki s\u00fcre\u00e7te g\u00f6zler il kongresine \u00e7evrilecek.","description":"YEN\u0130 Parti \u0130zmir\u2019de pazar g\u00fcn\u00fc ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen 13 il\u00e7e kongresi tamamland\u0131. Bergama\u2019dan Urla\u2019ya kadar delegeler sand\u0131k ba\u015f\u0131na giderken, \u00f6n se\u00e7imlerden\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/dokuzeylulcom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/dokuzeylul-com\/uploads\/2026\/10\/manset-tasarim-2026-10-04t194752372.png","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"YEN\u0130 Parti\u2019de 13 il\u00e7ede ba\u015fkanlar belli oldu"},"publishingPrinciples":"https:\/\/dokuzeylul.com\/yayin-ilkeleri","isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/dokuzeylul.com\/#organization","name":"Dokuz Eyl\u00fcl - G\u00fcncel \u0130zmir Haberleri dokuzeylul.com","image":"https:\/\/dokuzeylulcom.teimg.com\/dokuzeylul-com\/uploads\/2023\/09\/9-eylul-logo2.webp","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/dokuzeylulcom.teimg.com\/dokuzeylul-com\/uploads\/2023\/09\/9-eylul-logo2.webp","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AJANSLAR","url":"https:\/\/dokuzeylul.com"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sinan Gen\u00e7","url":"https:\/\/dokuzeylul.com\/muhabir\/132\/sinan-genc"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/dokuzeylul.com\/#organization","name":"Dokuz Eyl\u00fcl - G\u00fcncel \u0130zmir Haberleri dokuzeylul.com","url":"https:\/\/dokuzeylul.com"}}</script>


